  "prefLabel": "Eng 308.01 License",
  "priorExpiration": "2020-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 308.01 License. An applicant for licensure as a professional engineer, who has met satisfactorily all the requirements of RSA 310-A:2-27 and the board’s administrative rules, and who has paid all of the fees, shall be issued a license.\n\nSource. #6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-20\n\nNew. #13942, eff 6-25-24",
